      I’m also passionate about education. I volunteer with <a href="https://amphibious.mit.edu/">Amphibious Achievement</a>, 
      an organization that mentors high school students in Boston. Additionally, through MIT Global Teaching Labs, I’ve also been able 
      to design and lead computer science programs in Cape Verde. These experiences have allowed me to combine my interest in 
      technology with my commitment to helping others learn and grow.
    </p>
